{"id":"7c4480d2ba5fc4fa","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-zfc-comb-fat-stationary-set.md","title":"ZFC Comb Fat Stationary Set","display":"df-zfc-comb-fat-stationary-set — ZFC Comb Fat Stationary Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-comb-fat-stationary-set","aliases":["58-df-zfc-comb-fat-stationary-set"],"display":"df-zfc-comb-fat-stationary-set — ZFC Comb Fat Stationary Set","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-comb-fat-stationary-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-comb-fat-stationary-set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-comb-fat-stationary-set — ZFC Comb Fat Stationary Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\kappa,C,D,\\alpha,\\delta\\in V\">\\(S,\\kappa,C,D,\\alpha,\\delta\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (cofinality operation)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,D,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,D,R)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a> 的严格良序序型关系。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCombFatStationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCombFatStationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 上使用，取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a> 所定的唯一共尾度；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>序型关系的第一参数为输出序数，第三参数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\times D\">\\(D\\times D\\)</span> 上的严格关系。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}fat\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombFatStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\omega\\in\\kappa\\land \\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land \\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to\\exists D\\subseteq S\\cap C\\;\\left(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,D,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in D\\times D:x\\in y\\})\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\kappa\\;(\\delta\\neq0\\land\\delta=\\bigcup(D\\cap\\delta)\\to\\delta\\in D)\\right)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}fat\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombFatStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\omega\\in\\kappa\\land \\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land \\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to\\exists D\\subseteq S\\cap C\\;\\left(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,D,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in D\\times D:x\\in y\\})\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\kappa\\;(\\delta\\neq0\\land\\delta=\\bigcup(D\\cap\\delta)\\to\\delta\\in D)\\right)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus every club in the regular uncountable cardinal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> contains, inside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>, a closed subset of every order type below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-club.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-club.md","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-club.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md","status":"resolved","id":"5d2cd56a38a81b7a","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,D,R)$ 使用 [[../batch11/58-df-order-type.md]] 的严格良序序型关系。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)$ 仅在 $\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$ 上使用，取 [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]] 所定的唯一共尾度；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)$ 仅在 $\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$ 上使用，取 [[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]] 所定的唯一共尾度；$\\mathrm{Ord}$ 见 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\kappa,C,D,\\alpha,\\delta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}:\\mathrm{Ord}\\to\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCombFatStationarySet}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cf}(\\alpha)=\\mathrm{cf}(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"D\\times D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comb\\text{-}fat\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCombFatStationarySet}_S(S,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\omega\\in\\kappa\\land \\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land \\forall C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\to\\exists D\\subseteq S\\cap C\\;\\left(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\alpha,D,\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in D\\times D:x\\in y\\})\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\kappa\\;(\\delta\\neq0\\land\\delta=\\bigcup(D\\cap\\delta)\\to\\delta\\in D)\\right)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":2020,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1639","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-comb-fat-stationary-set.md|58-df-zfc-comb-fat-stationary-set]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","5582a281f15a33c2","04670bdc8b64b8dd","315ad00b8744fdfc","5d2cd56a38a81b7a"]}